---
import DocsLayout from "@/layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="FAQ">
  <h1>FAQ</h1>

  <h2>Where are my notes stored?</h2>
  <p class="muted">By default, in <code>~/Writr</code> as plain files.</p>

  <h2>How do I back up or sync?</h2>
  <p class="muted">
    Because your notes are files, you can use Time Machine, iCloud, Dropbox, Git, or any sync tool you trust.
  </p>

  <h2>Why can’t I save outside the root folder?</h2>
  <p class="muted">
    File operations are restricted to the notes root directory to prevent accidental edits outside your vault.
  </p>

  <h2>How do images work?</h2>
  <p class="muted">
    Drag & drop copies images into <code>~/Writr/image/</code> and inserts embeds like <code>![[image/&lt;file&gt;]]</code>.
  </p>

  <h2>AI troubleshooting</h2>
  <p class="muted">
    AI writing is optional and requires a user-provided OpenRouter API key stored locally.
  </p>
</DocsLayout>

